# Local secrets and machine-specific files

This project keeps local-only material out of version control.

Keep these local:
- credentials
- API keys
- tokens
- machine-specific paths
- cached harness output that is not part of the canonical environment definition

If a file in this directory is needed at runtime, load it as an ignored secret rather than shipping it into the agent sandbox or the repository.

Local files that must stay out of git:
- `docs/specification/local-secrets.md`
- `docs/specification/prime-intellect-api-key.md`
- any `.env`, `.env.*`, or credential file

If you add local tooling that produces machine-specific artifacts, add those artifact paths here too.
